# Four Spirit Wolves ordered one at a time, 45 ticks apart, onto an Aramon Barracks (arakeep,
# 7x12) from the south: each late attacker walks to its own free origin on the rectangle.
name melee-keep-late
ticks 1200
seed 7
players 2
team 0 0
team 1 1
wanderers off
map flat 140 140
type w fbi zonwolf
type keep fbi arakeep
group W1 0 w 1 cells 60,110 weapons=on
group W2 0 w 1 cells 60,114 weapons=on
group W3 0 w 1 cells 63,110 weapons=on
group W4 0 w 1 cells 63,114 weapons=on
